'''Jawanan''' is a [[Skyrim:Redguard|Redguard]] [[Skyrim:Fletcher (class)|fletcher]]. He will only appear as the vendor in the [[Skyrim:Fletcher (place)|Fletcher]] shop in [[Skyrim:Solitude|Solitude]] if [[Skyrim:Fihada|Fihada]], the original owner, dies.

Jawanan wears a set of farm [[Skyrim:Clothes#000209a6|clothes]], a pair of [[Skyrim:Boots#000209a5|boots]], and a [[Skyrim:Hat#000209aa|hat]]. He is equipped with an [[Skyrim:Iron Dagger|iron dagger]], and carries a [[Skyrim:Key to Solitude Fletcher|key]] to the store, as well as a selection of [[Skyrim:Leveled Lists#Common|common loot and gold]].
{{NewLeft}}
==Dialogue==
He will greet you by saying: 
:''"Ah, yet another new face. I'm from [[Lore:Hammerfell|Hammerfell]], you see. I can hardly keep track of all the people I've been meeting."''
:''"Always good to see a fellow traveler. I hope you've found the roads relatively safe. Free from dragons, at the very least..."'' 
:''"Fletching suits me. It's difficult, and sometimes tedious. But a well made arrow strikes forth like the fury of a god."''
:''"If you're looking for any archery or fletching supplies, you should see [[Skyrim:Fihada|Fihada]]. I'm just the apprentice."'' 

:'''You're a long way from home, then.'''
:''"Aye, but I'll be here in Solitude for longer still. Fihada's skill as a fletcher drew me to this place. I wanted to learn. And there is still much of Skyrim I wish to see. I hear there is a city, [[Skyrim:Windhelm|Wind-Helm]], that is nearly white with... What do you call it? Ah yes! Snow. And far to the west lies a ruin. [[Skyrim:Volskygge|Volskygge]]. Inside, there is said to be a wall, black as night. And it speaks! In the ancient Dragon tongue! There are wonders in this place I never dreamed imaginable."'' 
:'''I've been traveling all over. Even been to Helgen...'''
:''"Where [[Skyrim:Alduin|the Dragon]] [[Skyrim:Unbound|attacked]]? We've heard rumors of death and... and fire from the skies. But no real news."'' 
:'''The rumors are all true.'''
:''"Then we should soon be selling arrows by the bushel. A sword is no good against a dragon."''

Should you bid farewell to him:
:''"Stop back anytime."''
:''"Good to talk to a fellow traveler."''

===Conversations===
He will sometimes talk to Fihada:

'''Fihada''': ''"How's it coming there, Jawanan?"''<br>
'''Jawanan''': ''"Slow, but looking good, sir."''<br>
'''Fihada''': ''"Slow's the only way to do it! Work too hard and you'll warp the wood."''

'''Jawanan''': ''"Fihada, where did you learn how to make bows so well?"''<br>
'''Fihada''': ''"The same place I learned my charm and quick wits: I used to be an Imperial ranger, my boy!"''<br>
'''Jawanan''': ''"Wish I could learn some of that charm. I'm just good with bows, not people."''<br>
'''Fihada''': ''"You'd make a better Imperial ranger than me. I may have charmed the locals, but my fellow soldiers hated my waggling tongue."''

When in the Winking Skeever he can be overheard attempting to flirt:

:'''Jawanan:''' ''"So, um, mind if I buy you a drink?"''
:'''Vivienne Onis:''' ''"Not if you were the last man in the Empire."''

:'''Jawanan:''' ''"So, um, mind if I buy you a drink?"''
:'''Erdi:''' ''"Aw, that's so sweet of you! Thanks!"''

